 rby Monarch butterfly</p><p>habitat</p><p>SEE Monarch eggs\, caterpillars\
 , and</p><p>chrysalises</p><p>Talk with the architects of the garden</p><p
 >Tour their home garden and learn about</p><p>propagating plants for a but
 terfly habitat</p><p>Return to the park for lunch with friends</p><p>Pleas
 e RSVP so we can plan</p><p><a href="https://forms.gle/fVBKd26TFYJYK76TA">
