DESCRIPTION:Come make a day of it! The Made Local Market is a one-day out
 door artisan market taking over the Pezzolo & Co. parking lot\, set under
  tents and open to everyone. Shop handcrafted goods from 15+ local makers
 \, including home goods\, vintage clothing\, jewelry\, ceramics\, culinar
 y treats\, and more. Fuel up with locally roasted coffee drinks and get y
 our kids (or yourself) a treat with complimentary face painting!\n\nTry y
 our luck in our raffle for a chance to win product from our vendors\, wit
 h proceeds benefiting Make It Home https://www.makeithomebayarea.org/ \, 
 our nonprofit partner dedicated to turning empty spaces into real homes f
 or those in need.\n\nAnd while you're here\, step inside our Outlet showr
 oom and shop brand-new designer furniture and décor at up to 30% off reta
 il.\n\nFree to attend. All are welcome. See you there.
