SUMMARY:Beautiful TRASH Exhibit - Opening Reception
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T183000
DTSTAMP:20260617T114315Z
UID:20260827T233000Z-20670@calendar.santarosa.edu
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260827T163000
ATTACH:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/live/image/gid/3/width/80/height/80/
 crop/1/src_region/0,0,355,355/626_Trash_art_exhibit.PNG
CATEGORIES:Arts,Department Events,District Events,Student Clubs Events
DESCRIPTION:The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features artworks from six student
 s who participated in a seven-week art residency program. TRASH (The Recol
 ogy Artstart Student Hub) is a collaboration between Recology Sonoma Marin
  and Artstart. The students selected trash from Recology's Materials Recov
 ery Facility and created art that inspires reflection on our habits with w
 aste.  An SRJC Libraries collaboration with Recology Sonoma Marin and Arts
 tart.  Opening reception for the Beautiful TRASH exhibit: 4:30-6:30pm.  On
 going exhibit: August 24 to December 11\, 2026.  SRJC Petaluma: 680 Sonoma
  Mtn. Parkway\, Petaluma\, CA 94954-2522For more information about the Her
 old Mahoney Library Gallery\, visit their website here. (https://libraries
 .santarosa.edu/mahoney_gallery)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260622T215221Z
LOCATION:Herold Mahoney Library Gallery - Petaluma Campus
URL:https://calendar.santarosa.edu/event/20670-beautiful-trash-exhibit-ope
 ning-reception
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Beautiful TRASH exhibit features art
 works from six students who participated in a seven-week art residency pro
 gram. TRASH (The Recology Artstart Student Hub) is a collaboration between
  Recology Sonoma Marin and Artstart. The students selected trash from Reco
 logy's Materials Recovery Facility and created art that inspires reflectio
 n on our habits with waste.</p><p>  An SRJC Libraries collaboration with R
 ecology Sonoma Marin and Artstart.</p><p>  Opening reception for the Beaut
 iful TRASH exhibit: 4:30-6:30pm.<br />  Ongoing exhibit: August 24 to Dece
 mber 11\, 2026.<br />  SRJC Petaluma: 680 Sonoma Mtn. Parkway\, Petaluma\,
  CA 94954-2522</p><p><a href="https://libraries.santarosa.edu/mahoney_gall
 ery" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information about the Herold 
 Mahoney Library Gallery\, visit their website here.</a></p>
